  "jp": { kind: "e-visa", requirement: "eVisa (conditional)", stay: "以边检批准为准", notes: "Passengers transiting through Narita or Haneda airport may apply for a shore pass to enter Japan for no more than 72 hours without a visa, subject to the discretion of immigration authorities and certain conditions. Passengers of approved cruise ships do not require a visa if they stay no longer than 15 days. e-Visa is available if residing in Brazil, Cambodia, Canada, Saudi Arabia, Singapore, South Africa, Taiwan, United Arab Emirates, the United Kingdom and the United States. It is a single entry visa for tourism" },
