  "kr": { kind: "e-visa", requirement: "Online Visa required", stay: "以边检批准为准", notes: "Visa not required for direct or transit visitors to Jeju Island up to 30 days. Visa not required for 30 days as a transit tourist (category B-2) to or from the United States , Canada , Australia , New Zealand , the United Kingdom , Ireland , Cyprus and 29 Schengen member states . They must hold an onward ticket and a physical visa sticker affixed to the passport (except for Australia and the United Kingdom where VEVO and eVisa services are accepted). Residence cards are not accepted. Any layovers between South Kore" },
